    "description": "Objective\n\nRealign the Sign-Up list views with the four-status model from BUILD-18.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* REMOVE the Flagged list view (Status = Flagged no longer exists)\n\n* Redefine Fraudulent Sign Ups -> Fraud Flag = True, OR Fraud Review Status = Suspected/Confirmed — confirm which with Ops\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* No list view references a Flagged status\n\n* Fraud view returns the set Ops expects\n\nDependencies\n\nBUILD-18 (complete), BUILD-17 (complete).\n\nOpen Questions\n\n* Fraud Flag vs Fraud Review Status as the filter — needs an Ops answer.\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nSmall ticket, but leaving it undone means broken views in front of Reps right now. Prioritise.\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~2h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 35.",
